---
title: Observer Pattern Notification Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Subject
    participant LoggerObs as Logger
    participant AlertObs as Alerter
    Client->>Subject: set_value(42)
    Subject->>Subject: update state
    Subject->>LoggerObs: notify(42)
    Subject->>AlertObs: notify(42)
    LoggerObs-->>Subject: logged
    AlertObs-->>Subject: alert sent
